{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dive into multiple modes like career, quick fights, or local and online multiplayer. Whether you're chasing a belt or just throwing down with friends, Muay Mayhem brings tight, satisfying action that hits hard.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stand-Up Only Gameplay \u2013 Pure striking. No ground game, just hands, feet, knees, and elbows</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fighter Stats \u2013 Level up and customize your fighter\u2019s strengths and fighting style</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fight Settings \u2013 Adjust rules, difficulty, and round structure to your liking</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Character Customization \u2013 Change up your fighter\u2019s appearance and vibe</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Emotes \u2013 Taunt, flex, or celebrate mid-fight</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Game Modes</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Career Mode \u2013 Climb the ranks, earn rewards, and make a name for yourself</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Quick Fight Mode \u2013 Hop into a match instantly with no setup</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Player vs AI \u2013 Train or challenge smart computer opponents</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Local Multiplayer \u2013 Throw hands with friends on the same screen</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Online Multiplayer \u2013 Face off against players worldwide in real time</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Controls</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mouse &amp; Keyboard \u2013 Full support</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Controller \u2013 Partial support (improvements in progress)</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Developed by solo indie creator @TeepDev</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><br>Note: The Steam page may or may not be translated. The game itself is available in English.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746740?t=1763401999","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746740?t=1763401999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746740/3230efe7189691018ff53255c3d4c59c3bf82523/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763401999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746740/3230efe7189691018ff53255c3d4c59c3bf82523/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763401999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Muay Mayhem is a competitive fighting game that recreates ring and cage matches inspired by the martial art of Muay Thai. It features stylized hand-to-hand combat, including punches, kicks, elbow and knee strikes, and knockouts. While there is no graphic gore, the game contains animated violence and intense physical action that may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detail